OL,3,GNEWSANavy bomb experts given highest
OL,4,Ahumanitarian honour
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoyal Navy divers, who safely dispose
OL,7,Fof hundreds of bombs, shells and
OL,8,Fexplosive devices every year, have been
OL,9,Fawarded the military's highest
OL,10,Fhumanitarian award.
OL,12,FBravo Squadron of the Diving and Threat
OL,13,FExploitation Group, which is split
OL,14,Fbetween Portsmouth and Devonport Naval
OL,15,FBases, was given the Firmin Sword of
OL,16,FPeace during a ceremony at the
OL,17,FHampshire base for its work throughout
OL,18,F2024.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,337,330,200,160,0,100
