OL,3,GNEWSANavy bomb experts given highest
OL,4,Ahumanitarian honour
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarlier this week in Falmouth, the unit
OL,7,Fmoved an unexploded World War Two bomb
OL,8,Fout to sea, where it will be detonated
OL,9,Fnext week.
OL,11,FThe award is given to units that have
OL,12,Fmade the most valuable contribution
OL,13,Ftowards establishing good relations
OL,14,Fwith a community at home or abroad.
